---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin invokes supplyTokens()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_results: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_results --> q_revert_results: results not yet published
    q_revert_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_results --> q_check_supplied: results published
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_dup: tokens already supplied
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadySupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_total: tokens not yet supplied
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: total = totalTokensAllocated + legionFee + referrerFees
    q_transfer --> q_mark: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), total)
    q_mark --> [*]: tokensSupplied = true; emit TokensSupplied(total)

    note right of q_calc_total
        INV-001: Token supply includes allocated tokens plus all fees
        INV-002: Supply only allowed after results publication and before any claims
    end note
